        "eyebrow": "Our approach",
        "title": "We do not leave when the pump is installed",
        "body": "<p>Most water projects fail within five years because nobody funded the maintenance. We fund it for fifteen, and we train the local committee that runs it.</p><ul><li>Community-elected water committees</li><li>Local mechanics on retainer, not volunteers</li><li>Sensors on every pump, reporting daily</li></ul>",
